    "work_id": "gez-anaphoras/epiphanius",
    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Epiphanius.0005",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Mysterious is He who cannot be comprehended by the thought, and lofty is He who cannot be known by the understanding.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 403,
    "date_range": [
      380,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "gez-anaphoras/epiphanius#EthLit.Epiphanius.0006",
    "work_id": "gez-anaphoras/epiphanius",
    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Epiphanius.0006",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "There follow a great number of similar clauses commencing : Exalted is He, Deep is He, High is He, Low is He, Powerful is He, Victorious is He, Wise is He, Prudent is He, Mighty is He, Strong is He, etc., etc., and then the paragraph ends as follows:",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 403,
    "date_range": [
      380,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "gez-anaphoras/epiphanius#EthLit.Epiphanius.0007",
    "work_id": "gez-anaphoras/epiphanius",
    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Epiphanius.0007",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "He alone is God, King of kings and Lord of lords, and when He saw that the blood of the holy prophets, from the blood of righteous Abel to the blood of Zacharias the son of Barachias, availed not to save the world, He sent to us His Son as a Saviour to help and ransom and to bring before Him the memorial of the living and the dead.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 403,
    "date_range": [
      380,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
