    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Epiphanius.0028",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "THE EUCHARISTIC THANKSGIVING WHICH THE CCCXVIII ORTHODOX MADE TOGETHER WITH ONE VOICE",
