    "canonical_ref": "EthLit.Epiphanius.0031",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The priest saith: We declare the essence of the Father with His Son and the essence of the Son with His Father. Before all creation, and before the making of the heavens; before the earth was ‘founded’,! and before the mountains and the hills rose up, and before the heights of the air appeared, etc., etc.",
